# 🌿 LogiFlow App: AI-Driven Food Rescue & Inventory Marketplace

![LogiFlow Logo](/assets/images/logiflowlogo.png)

> **LogiFlow** is an AI-driven food rescue platform. We connect producers, merchants, and end consumers to fight food waste by redistributing agricultural surplus, bakery items, dairy, and grocery products at accessible prices.

---

## 🚀 About the Project

Originally conceptualized in Flutter, the application was completely rewritten as a responsive **React Web app in TypeScript**, optimized for high performance and smooth user experience.

- **Event:** Developed during the **Gemma 4 Good Kaggle Hackathon**.
- **Web Application:** [https://applogiflow.ai.studio/](https://applogiflow.ai.studio/)

---

## 🌟 Key Features

### 📲 Public Feed & Gemma 4 AI Insights
- **Real-Time Inventory Feed:** Dynamic status badges:
  - `MAIS`: Featured products from subscribers.
  - `RESGATE URGENTE`: Items expiring in $\le 3$ days.
  - `SAUDÁVEL`: Fresh and unprocessed items.
- **AI Insights:** Contextual banner powered by **Gemma 4**, analyzing items near expiration in real time and suggesting rescue strategies.

### 🛒 Consumer Marketplace & Food Search
- Full-text search and category filtering (*Bakery, Produce, Dairy, Beverages, and Pantry*).
- **Direct Messaging:** Real-time chat between buyers and sellers/producers to coordinate local pickup.

### 📊 Seller Dashboard & Inventory Management
- **Real-Time Dashboard:** Overview tracking total active items, items near expiration ($\le 5$ days), and expired products.
- **Advanced Stock Management:** Quick filtering by item state (*All, New, Cleaned, Packaged, Near Expiration*) with rapid quantity adjustment.
- **Multi-Tier Seller Plans:**
  - **Free:** Up to 50 items.
  - **Mais:** R$ 10.00 per batch of 1,000 items.
  - *Soft-lock enforcement (prevents new listings upon reaching limits without disrupting active operations).*
- **Full Listing Management:** Support for multiple photos, expiration dates, emergency food rescue flags, and producer tags.

### 🤖 Gemma 4 Conversational Assistant
- Dedicated chatbot for:
  - Rapid inventory lookups.
  - Technical food preservation advice.
  - Zero-waste recipe recommendations.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** React (Web, Responsive)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **AI / LLM:** Google Gemma 4
- **Payments:** Stripe (Simulated)
- **Styling / UI:** CSS3 / HTML5

---

